Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.29,0:21:33.71,Ending-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2\be2}I'll never forget the promises we exchanged
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.71,0:21:36.17,Ending-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be2}I still see it when I close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.17,0:21:37.79,Ending-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be2}I'll move forward as I cast off
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.79,0:21:41.67,Ending-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,580)\blur2\be2}this darkness engulfing me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.95,0:21:57.78,Ending-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,480)\blur2\be2}How long will it be before
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.78,0:22:04.09,Ending-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,480)\blur2\be2}I see that lost future again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.09,0:22:08.72,Ending-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,480)\blur2\be2}I'll walk upon this Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.72,0:22:10.79,Ending-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be2}and pierce this shadowy veil of unease,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.79,0:22:14.40,Ending-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,580)\blur2\be2}as many times as necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.40,0:22:19.88,Ending-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,480)\blur2\be2}The clock that's endlessly ticked away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.88,0:22:25.20,Ending-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,320)\blur2\be2}now tells of the beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.20,0:22:30.48,Ending-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,480)\blur2\be2}Let's open the once-closed door,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.48,0:22:35.85,Ending-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,580)\blur2\be2}with these unwavering feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.96,0:22:41.66,Ending-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be2}My heart started racing once again to paint the future
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.66,0:22:45.70,Ending-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,480)\blur2\be2}Even if I get stuck in a maze,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.70,0:22:51.54,Ending-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be2}the beautiful blue sky will always be waiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.54,0:22:53.83,Ending-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be2}So I won't be afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.83,0:22:59.96,Ending-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1020)\blur2\be2}No matter what happens next, I won't give in
Dialogue: 5,0:00:04.44,0:00:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Homura{*}-chan{*}, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:07.92,0:00:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to become a magical girl.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:11.41,0:00:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:12.57,0:00:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:14.45,0:00:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally know what I want.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:17.20,0:00:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I've found the wish I truly want granted.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:19.67,0:00:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll use my life for that wish.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:22.66,0:00:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:23.82,0:00:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Because then, what have I...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:25.45,0:00:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What have I been fighting for?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:35.12,0:00:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:36.41,0:00:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:38.05,0:00:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But I believe it's because you've protected me for so long and placed so much hope on me
Dialogue: 5,0:00:44.62,0:00:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,that I'm the person I am now.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:47.30,0:00:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I really am sorry.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:52.69,0:00:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the answer I've finally found.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:56.63,0:00:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Please believe in me.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:58.43,0:01:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise that what you've done\Nfor me will not be in vain.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:02.81,0:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka...
Dialogue: 5,0:01:08.64,0:01:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you're the central point of karmic destiny from many different timelines,
Dialogue: 5,0:01:13.30,0:01:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter how enormous the wish, \Nyou will most likely be able to realize it.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:16.59,0:01:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling the truth, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:18.39,0:01:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Kaname Madoka...
Dialogue: 5,0:01:20.65,0:01:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,what is the wish you will pay for with your soul?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.12,0:01:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 5,0:01:36.38,0:01:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to erase all witches\N before they are even born.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:39.78,0:01:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I will erase every single witch in \Nevery universe, past and future...
Dialogue: 5,0:01:43.16,0:01:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,with my own hands.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:48.99,0:01:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If that wish...
Dialogue: 5,0:01:50.54,0:01:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If that wish were to come true, it wouldn't just\Nbe on the scale of temporal manipulation...
Dialogue: 5,0:01:55.24,0:01:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be opposing karmic destiny—\Nthe very laws of causality themselves!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:59.00,0:02:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you truly intend to become a god?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:01.55,0:02:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you call it.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:04.18,0:02:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All those magical girls who held onto their\Nhopes and fought against witches...
Dialogue: 5,0:02:09.38,0:02:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to see them cry.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:11.31,0:02:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I want them to stay smiling until the end.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:14.12,0:02:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If any rule or law stands in my way...
Dialogue: 5,0:02:16.20,0:02:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I will destroy it. I will rewrite it.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:19.61,0:02:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That is my prayer. That is my wish.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:22.95,0:02:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now grant it, Incubator!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:50.60,0:02:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaname{*}-san{*}, do you truly understand just how daunting that wish is?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:55.01,0:02:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:58.40,0:03:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It means you must fight without pause throughout all timelines, past and future, for all eternity.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:06.35,0:03:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It means you'll cease to exist as an individual.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:10.71,0:03:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Death would be a kinder fate.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:13.51,0:03:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be firmly implanted in this universe as a concept—a principle that destroys witches.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:19.92,0:03:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine. That's what I intend to do.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:22.97,0:03:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone says it's wrong to have hope,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:26.29,0:03:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I will tell them they're wrong every single time.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:31.28,0:03:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I know my determination will never waver.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:33.84,0:03:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine, then, isn't it?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:35.98,0:03:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think you can do it,\N you've just gotta do it!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:39.88,0:03:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you've found your\Nreason to fight, haven't you?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:42.38,0:03:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You've decided yourself\Nnot to run away, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:44.90,0:03:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all there is to it!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:46.36,0:03:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All that's left is to run full steam ahead!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:49.88,0:03:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:50.65,0:03:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Kyouko{*}-chan{*}.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:52.95,0:03:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that means you'll\Nbe needing this again.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:57.24,0:03:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:02.71,0:04:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not just making\Npeople's hopes come true.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:05.71,0:04:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're becoming hope itself.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:08.05,0:04:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The hope of us all.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:07.67,0:06:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't let your prayers end in despair.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:20.76,0:06:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}None of you have to hate anyone, or curse anyone...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:25.58,0:06:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll bear the full, dreadful weight of all your karmic destinies.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:28.78,0:06:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1180)\i1}So please, believe in yourselves until the very end.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:54.10,0:06:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:55.80,0:06:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay now.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:58.16,0:07:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to hate anyone anymore.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:00.75,0:07:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to curse anyone anymore.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:04.06,0:07:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go back, before you took that form, \Nand shoulder that burden for you.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:39.06,0:07:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I...?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:40.37,0:07:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The universe is realigning itself in accordance with the new laws Madoka has brought forth.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:47.41,0:07:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right. You were also a user of temporal magic.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:52.83,0:07:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then, let us witness together...
Dialogue: 5,0:07:54.93,0:07:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,what kind of end the existence known as "Kaname Madoka" will meet.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:00.22,0:08:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the Soul Gem her prayer created.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:04.25,0:08:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That much...
Dialogue: 5,0:08:07.88,0:08:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you even begin to grasp the \Namount of despair Madoka must bear
Dialogue: 5,0:08:11.21,0:08:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,as the price for her immense wish?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:14.38,0:08:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She was able to bring forth enough hope to give birth to an entire universe.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:18.39,0:08:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But that much hope also brings with it\Nenough despair to end a universe.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:24.86,0:08:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only natural.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:58.05,0:08:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It's okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:03.85,0:09:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My wish was to erase all witches.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:10.89,0:09:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If that really comes true,
Dialogue: 5,0:09:14.00,0:09:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,then even I will have no reason to despair!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:41.57,0:09:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka, your life no longer\Nhas a beginning or an end.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:49.27,0:09:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a single trace or memory of your life on Earth will remain here.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:54.61,0:10:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your existence has shifted onto a higher\Nplane, and you remain only as a concept.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:00.66,0:10:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can perceive you, and likewise, \Nyou cannot interact with anyone else.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:06.27,0:10:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You are no longer part of this universe.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:10.09,0:10:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:11.46,0:10:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to say this is the ending Madoka wished for?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:14.55,0:10:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You think this is a fair reward for everything she's done?!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:18.05,0:10:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:22.46,0:10:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This is worse than dying...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:25.34,0:10:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So much worse...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:28.44,0:10:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No. You're wrong, Homura{*}-chan{*}.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:32.19,0:10:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,As I am now, I can see everything that ever has or will have happened.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:36.81,0:10:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All the universes that could have been, \Nand those that may yet come to be.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:42.64,0:10:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single one.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:43.92,0:10:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:45.17,0:10:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I know.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:48.00,0:10:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I know just how hard you tried to help me across all those timelines.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:54.17,0:10:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it all.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:55.95,0:10:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw the countless tears you shed,\Nand the countless wounds you bore,
Dialogue: 5,0:10:59.42,0:11:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and yet you kept going, all for my sake.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:02.39,0:11:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I never knew until now.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:06.21,0:11:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I really am.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:16.12,0:11:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't until I became this way\Nthat I could truly know who you were.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:20.88,0:11:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I found out that I had such a great\Nfriend by my side this whole time.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:26.32,0:11:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I know now.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:29.31,0:11:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Homura{*}-chan{*}, thank you.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:32.62,0:11:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You were my very best friend.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:37.41,0:11:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But now you can't go back home, and you'll be separated from everyone you cared about!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:44.22,0:11:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you really be trapped here all alone, for all eternity?!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:50.24,0:11:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not alone.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:51.60,0:11:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone... Everyone will always be with me.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:55.97,0:12:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Because from now on, I'll be everywhere, \Nthroughout all of time and space.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:00.07,0:12:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So even if you can't see or hear me, \NI'll be right there by your side.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:05.75,0:12:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really all right with that, Madoka?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:08.83,0:12:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I'll forget you?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:11.45,0:12:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I won't even know you're there?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:16.21,0:12:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:17.58,0:12:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too early to give up.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:20.09,0:12:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You followed me all the way out here, after all.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:24.11,0:12:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So even after you've gone back to your world,
Dialogue: 5,0:12:29.23,0:12:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,you just might be able to remember me.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:37.25,0:12:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be all right.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:38.57,0:12:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I just know it will.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:40.52,0:12:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to believe.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:41.91,0:12:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:43.90,0:12:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, magical girls make hopes and dreams come true!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:50.20,0:12:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure if it's small enough,\Na real miracle just might happen.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:55.54,0:12:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:56.46,0:12:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka, don't go!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:59.30,0:13:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I have to go guide everyone else.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:03.88,0:13:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to see you again someday.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:08.47,0:13:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll just say goodbye to you until then, okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:12.97,0:13:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:33.57,0:13:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Number 25, Kamijou Kyousuke.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:37.14,0:13:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be playing {\i1}Ave Maria{\i0}.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:53.65,0:13:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for all the trouble.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:56.98,0:13:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry too.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:00.15,0:14:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way I could save you would be\Nto make it like none of this had happened,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:05.90,0:14:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,which means that this future\Nwould have to disappear as well.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:10.28,0:14:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But I got the feeling that you didn't really want it to turn out like that.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:19.17,0:14:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I truly value your wish and all\Nthe hard work you put into it.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:24.67,0:14:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it was pointless in the end at all.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:28.17,0:14:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:32.08,0:14:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:34.14,0:14:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This is fine.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:36.22,0:14:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess all I really wanted was to hear him play one more time.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:42.81,0:14:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted more and more people to be able to experience it.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:48.19,0:14:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I've remembered that, I'm satisfied.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:52.26,0:14:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any more regrets.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:55.65,0:14:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I am a little upset about the way things turned out,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:59.18,0:15:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't be mad at Hitomi.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:01.48,0:15:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She's almost too good for him,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:04.78,0:15:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,so she'll make him happy, won't she?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:11.18,0:15:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:14.46,0:15:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get going, shall we?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:16.83,0:15:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:46.05,0:15:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:54.82,0:15:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Sayaka?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:56.17,0:15:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Sayaka?!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:58.32,0:15:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gone.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:59.97,0:16:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She followed the {\i1}Way of the Cycle{\i0} and passed on.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:03.07,0:16:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Miki{*}-san{*} used up all of her power in that last attack, didn't she?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:09.98,0:16:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That idiot! What good was saving the\Nguy she loved if she vanished herself?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:17.64,0:16:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Dummy... Just when we'd finally become friends...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:22.00,0:16:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the fate of all magical girls.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:24.74,0:16:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you were told that\Nwhen you attained this power.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:28.50,0:16:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Before the hope we wished for brings\Nabout an equal amount of misfortune,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:33.20,0:16:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,we have no choice but to vanish from this world.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:42.17,0:16:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:45.94,0:16:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Akemi{*}-san{*}?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:48.68,0:16:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:51.59,0:16:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:08.83,0:17:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka! Madoka!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:11.99,0:17:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep. That looks just like her.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:18.49,0:17:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Tatsuya. That's not nice.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:20.60,0:17:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't pull a girl's hair, okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:23.42,0:17:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka! Madoka!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:25.28,0:17:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Are you all right?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:25.28,0:17:28.11,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Madoka! Madoka!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:28.11,0:17:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. Sorry for bothering you.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:33.13,0:17:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:37.76,0:17:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:41.53,0:17:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:43.55,0:17:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:46.39,0:17:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She's this invisible friend he\Nplays with when he's alone.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:52.66,0:17:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty common for children, I guess.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:55.68,0:17:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I remember her too.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:59.06,0:18:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know her as well?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:02.65,0:18:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she a character from\Nan anime or something?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:04.45,0:18:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:06.33,0:18:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I've heard her name,\Nbut I can't quite place it.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:08.98,0:18:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:10.69,0:18:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I saw her somewhere with Tatsuya.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:16.04,0:18:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes that name just sounds really familiar.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:22.91,0:18:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:26.67,0:18:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:30.07,0:18:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Those ribbons are really cute!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:32.68,0:18:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're just the kind I like!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:35.17,0:18:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of surprised.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:38.45,0:18:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like them?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:41.34,0:18:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't look good\Non an old woman like me.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:44.52,0:18:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had a daughter, I'd probably get her to wear them.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:55.32,0:18:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:56.75,0:19:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Theoretically, I suppose the system you described could have worked.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:01.72,0:19:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a theory. It really happened.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:08.46,0:19:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, we have no way of proving it.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:11.25,0:19:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If the rules of the universe really were rewritten as you say,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:16.17,0:19:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,we'd have no way to verify that now.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:19.55,0:19:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And since you're the only one\Nwho remembers that world,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:23.05,0:19:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no way to tell if your memories are real or simply imagined.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:29.98,0:19:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it is true that even we can't explain why
Dialogue: 5,0:19:35.35,0:19:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Soul Gems simply disappear when they can no longer be purified.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:37.90,0:19:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why these "witches" in your story are such an interesting concept.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:43.48,0:19:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,As a means of collecting human emotional energy, it certainly has its appeal!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:48.41,0:19:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If such a convenient means\Nhad been available to us,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:50.93,0:19:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,we Incubators might have employed a very different strategy.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:55.97,0:19:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. That's the kind of creatures you are.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:00.37,0:20:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the world you mentioned, there weren't any wraiths like the ones we fight here, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:07.07,0:20:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Gathering despair must have been a much faster process.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:10.89,0:20:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't as simple as that.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:12.77,0:20:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We weren't exactly on the greatest terms with you.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:18.10,0:20:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't get human values at all.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:26.75,0:20:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just because witches are no\N longer born into this world
Dialogue: 5,0:20:30.34,0:20:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}doesn't mean the curses harbored by mankind have ceased to exist.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:34.89,0:20:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The distortions of the world\Nhave merely changed form,
Dialogue: 5,0:20:37.50,0:20:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and now prey on people from the shadows.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:46.85,0:20:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The miasma is pretty thick tonight.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:49.62,0:20:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,These wraiths are just popping\Nup one after the other.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:52.60,0:20:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no end to them.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:54.80,0:20:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Complaining won't get us anywhere.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:56.74,0:20:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:02.58,0:21:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This irredeemable world may be nothing but a cycle of sadness and hatred,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:08.07,0:21:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but even so, this was a place that she wanted to protect.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:18.63,0:21:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I remember that.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:21.46,0:21:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I will never forget it.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:24.95,0:21:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That is why...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:27.40,0:21:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will keep on fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.19,0:21:30.23,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Credits}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.40,0:23:01.44,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Epilogue}
Dialogue: 5,0:23:30.57,0:23:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Keep it up.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:32.89,0:23:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
